Licensing of this repository
============================

This repository mixes three kinds of content. Each is licensed separately.

1. CODE  (MIT License, text below)
   - proposal-dev/pilot/            the measurement harness, configs, helper scripts
   - irp/analysis/scripts/          audit and inference scripts
   - any other *.py, *.ps1, *.sh, *.yaml file in the repository

2. DATA AND FIGURES  (Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International, CC BY 4.0; see LICENSE-DATA.md)
   - proposal-dev/pilot/results/    performance, energy and pilot measurements, run manifests
   - proposal-dev/pilot/eval-results/   per-problem EvalPlus scoring records
   - proposal-dev/pilot/e1/, proposal-dev/pilot/e4/   extension artefacts
   - irp/analysis/figures/          generated figures
   - irp/extensions/                registered protocols
   - any *.csv, *.json, *.png, *.svg data or figure file derived from the study's measurements

3. EVERYTHING ELSE  (all rights reserved)
   Coursework text, notes, drafts, dissertation chapters and other prose are
   Copyright (c) 2026 Amilka Moses and are not licensed for reuse.

Third-party components keep their own licences and are not relicensed here:
Qwen2.5-Coder (Apache-2.0), Phi-3-mini (MIT), HumanEval (MIT), EvalPlus (Apache-2.0),
MBPP (CC BY 4.0), llama.cpp (MIT), Python documentation (PSF-2.0). Model weights and
benchmark data are not stored in this repository.

